Installation: Copy TVHsync.jar into the plugins directory of TV-Browser and
restart TV-Browser. You can choose between the global plugin directory, which
resides in the TV-Browser installation directory, and your personal plugin
directory:
"~/.tvbrowser/<version>/plugins" for Linux/Unix users
"~/.var/app/org.tvbrowser.TVBrowser/.config/tvbrowser/<version>/plugins" for
the TV-Browser flatpak
"%APPDATA%\TV-Browser\<version>\plugins" for Windows users

Afterwards open the settings of TVHsync and enter the URL of your tvheadend
server, e.g. http://192.168.1.10:9981, and assign the TV-Browser channels to
the tvheadend channels in the "Channels" tab.
